# Dread Wight blocks Colossodon Yearling; with its end-of-combat trigger on the stack it is exiled. The trigger still puts a paralyzation counter on the Yearling and taps them, as the Wight last existed (CR 608.2h).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Dread Wight
Island x16
[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Swords to Plowshares
Colossodon Yearling
Island x15
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dread Wight.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Hand.Colossodon Yearling.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Colossodon Yearling > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Dread Wight > Colossodon Yearling)
[T4 Bot2.EndCombat]
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Dread Wight)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[Expect]
Exile = Dread Wight
Bot2.Battlefield.Colossodon Yearling.Counters.Paralyzation = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Colossodon Yearling.Tapped = true
